    "html": "<section class=\"lens-view lens-dispatch-view\"><h3>line-smooth-prepare · 1×1×1 workgroups × 256×1×1 lanes = 256 invocations</h3><svg class=\"lens-workgroups\" viewBox=\"0 0 640 24\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Workgroups\"><defs><pattern id=\"lens-gpu-spatial-analysis-line-smooth-kernel-hatched\" patternUnits=\"userSpaceOnUse\" width=\"6\" height=\"6\" patternTransform=\"rotate(45)\"><line x1=\"0\" y1=\"0\" x2=\"0\" y2=\"6\" stroke=\"#595959\" stroke-width=\"1\"></line></pattern></defs><rect x=\"1\" y=\"1\" width=\"17\" height=\"17\" data-provenance=\"metadata\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#181818\" stroke-width=\"3\" data-state=\"selection\" data-action=\"bind\" data-axis=\"workgroup\" data-key=\"0\"></rect></svg><h4>Workgroup 0 (default)</h4><svg class=\"lens-lanes\" viewBox=\"0 0 1280 256\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Lanes in expanded workgroup\"><defs><pattern id=\"lens-gpu-spatial-analysis-line-smooth-kernel-lanes-hatched\" patternUnits=\"userSpaceOnUse\" width=\"6\" height=\"6\" patternTransform=\"rotate(45)\"><line x1=\"0\" y1=\"0\" x2=\"0\" y2=\"6\" stroke=\"#595959\" stroke-width=\"1\"></line></pattern></defs><image width=\"1280\" height=\"256\" preserveAspectRatio=\"none\" image-rendering=\"pixelated\" data-provenance=\"metadata\" data-raster-width=\"32\" data-raster-height=\"8\" data-sampling=\"nearest\" href=\"data:image/png;base64,\"></image><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"0\"><text x=\"5\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">0</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"1\"><text x=\"45\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">1</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"2\"><text x=\"85\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">2</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"3\"><text x=\"125\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">3</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"4\"><text x=\"165\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">4</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"5\"><text x=\"205\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">5</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"6\"><text x=\"245\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">6</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"7\"><text x=\"285\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">7</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"8\"><text x=\"325\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">8</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"9\"><text x=\"365\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">9</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"10\"><text x=\"405\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">10</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"11\"><text x=\"445\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">11</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"12\"><text x=\"485\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">12</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"13\"><text x=\"525\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">13</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"14\"><text x=\"565\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">14</text></g></svg><p>256 lanes; first 15 and pinned lane labelled. Grey cells are idle or unavailable.</p><p>id probe not recorded; lane ids are computed from the dispatch shape · apple</p><figure class=\"lens-kernel-source\"><pre><code data-language=\"wgsl\"><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"1\">\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"2\">override INVOCATION_COUNT: u32;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"3\">override WGSL_KERNEL_DISPATCH_X: u32;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"4\">override WGSL_KERNEL_DISPATCH_Y: u32;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"5\">const positionsOffset: u32 = 0u;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line lens-source-line--binding\" data-line=\"6\">@group(0) @binding(0) var&lt;storage, read&gt; positions: array&lt;f32&gt;;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"7\">const lineOffsetsOffset: u32 = 0u;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line lens-source-line--binding\" data-line=\"8\">@group(0) @binding(1) var&lt;storage, read&gt; lineOffsets: array&lt;u32&gt;;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"9\">const smoothCountsOffset: u32 = 0u;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line lens-source-line--binding\" data-line=\"10\">@group(0) @binding(2) var&lt;storage, read_write&gt; smoothCounts: array&lt;u32&gt;;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"11\">const plainCountsOffset: u32 = 0u;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line lens-source-line--binding\" data-line=\"12\">@group(0) @binding(3) var&lt;storage, read_write&gt; plainCounts: array&lt;u32&gt;;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"13\">const smoothFlagsOffset: u32 = 0u;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line lens-source-line--binding\" data-line=\"14\">@group(0) @binding(4) var&lt;storage, read_write&gt; smoothFlags: array&lt;u32&gt;;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"15\">const LINE_COUNT: u32 = 223u;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"16\">const ROW_COUNT: u32 = 513u;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"17\">const CLOSED: bool = false;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"18\">\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"19\">fn getPosition(row: u32) -&gt; vec2&lt;f32&gt; {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"20\">  return vec2&lt;f32&gt;(positions[positionsOffset + 2u * row], positions[positionsOffset + 2u * row + 1u]);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"21\">}\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"22\">\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line lens-source-line--workgroup-size\" data-line=\"23\">@compute @workgroup_size(256)\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line lens-source-line--entry-point\" data-line=\"24\">fn main(\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"25\">  @builtin(local_invocation_index) localInvocationIndex: u32,\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"26\">  @builtin(workgroup_id) workgroupId: vec3&lt;u32&gt;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"27\">) {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"28\">  _ = &amp;positions;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"29\">  _ = &amp;lineOffsets;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"30\">  _ = &amp;smoothCounts;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"31\">  _ = &amp;plainCounts;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"32\">  _ = &amp;smoothFlags;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"33\">  _ = INVOCATION_COUNT;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"34\">  let workgroupIndex =\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"35\">    (workgroupId.z * WGSL_KERNEL_DISPATCH_Y + workgroupId.y) * WGSL_KERNEL_DISPATCH_X +\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"36\">    workgroupId.x;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"37\">  if (workgroupIndex &gt;= 16777216u) { return; }\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"38\">  let index = workgroupIndex * 256u + localInvocationIndex;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"39\">  if (index &gt;= INVOCATION_COUNT) {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"40\">    return;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"41\">  }\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"42\">  var smoothCount = 0u;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"43\">  var plainCount = 0u;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"44\">  if (index &lt; LINE_COUNT) {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"45\">    let start = min(lineOffsets[lineOffsetsOffset + index], ROW_COUNT);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"46\">    let end = min(max(lineOffsets[lineOffsetsOffset + index + 1u], start), ROW_COUNT);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"47\">    let count = end - start;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"48\">    var effectiveCount = count;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"49\">    if (CLOSED &amp;&amp; count &gt;= 2u &amp;&amp; all(getPosition(start) == getPosition(end - 1u))) {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"50\">      effectiveCount = count - 1u;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"51\">    }\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"52\">    let smoothable = select(count &gt;= 2u, effectiveCount &gt;= 3u, CLOSED);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"53\">    smoothCount = select(0u, effectiveCount, smoothable);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"54\">    plainCount = select(count, 0u, smoothable);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"55\">  }\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"56\">  smoothCounts[smoothCountsOffset + index] = smoothCount;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"57\">  plainCounts[plainCountsOffset + index] = plainCount;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"58\">  smoothFlags[smoothFlagsOffset + index] = select(0u, 1u, smoothCount &gt; 0u);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"59\">}\n</span></code></pre><table><thead><tr><th>Name</th><th>Resource</th><th>Access</th><th>Element type</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>positions<span class=\"lens-provenance lens-provenance--metadata\" title=\"Static metadata, not an execution measurement.\">metadata</span></td><td data-action=\"bind\" data-axis=\"buffer\" data-key=\"positions\">positions</td><td>read</td><td>f32</td></tr><tr><td>lineOffsets<span class=\"lens-provenance lens-provenance--metadata\" title=\"Static metadata, not an execution measurement.\">metadata</span></td><td data-action=\"bind\" data-axis=\"buffer\" data-key=\"lineOffsets\">lineOffsets</td><td>read</td><td>u32</td></tr><tr><td>smoothCounts<span class=\"lens-provenance lens-provenance--metadata\" title=\"Static metadata, not an execution measurement.\">metadata</span></td><td data-action=\"bind\" data-axis=\"buffer\" data-key=\"line-smooth-smooth-counts\">line-smooth-smooth-counts</td><td>read_write</td><td>u32</td></tr><tr><td>plainCounts<span class=\"lens-provenance lens-provenance--metadata\" title=\"Static metadata, not an execution measurement.\">metadata</span></td><td data-action=\"bind\" data-axis=\"buffer\" data-key=\"line-smooth-plain-counts\">line-smooth-plain-counts</td><td>read_write</td><td>u32</td></tr><tr><td>smoothFlags<span class=\"lens-provenance lens-provenance--metadata\" title=\"Static metadata, not an execution measurement.\">metadata</span></td><td data-action=\"bind\" data-axis=\"buffer\" data-key=\"line-smooth-smooth-flags\">line-smooth-smooth-flags</td><td>read_write</td><td>u32</td></tr></tbody></table><figcaption>GPULineSmooth/smooth-prepare · main · 06c9c452</figcaption></figure></section>",
